%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sovngarde
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988726549708828
    - rid: 4927988726549708829
    - rid: 4927988726549708830
    - rid: 4927988726549708831
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Despite all of the snow, this place is actually pretty temperate.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not sure whether to attribute that to this place being Nord heaven-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Or because Aetherius could be considered a place of pure and infinite
      energy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Since, you know, it's where magic comes from.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Guess I'll get moving...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah. The fog.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988726549708832
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I <i>could</i> get rid of this fog with the Clear Skies shout...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Or I could not do that!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The NPCs that are lost in there complaining about not being to make their
      way to Shor's Hall are a bunch of shmucks-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: You sort of just have to keep going straight from where you arrive.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... assuming the dead arrive at the same spot that I did.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Which may not be true now that I'm thinking about it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hrm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Anyway, it should just be a nice and easy walk to the Whalebone Bridge-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988726549708889
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: My nose...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah crap, is that blood!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hopefully they have cotton balls at the Hall of Valor...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Tripping right onto my face not withstanding, the trek was as easy as
      I remembered.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988726549708890
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: What brings you, wayfarer grim, to wander here, in Sovngarde, souls-end,
      Shor's gift to honored dead?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988726549708891
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's this pesky World-Eater problem I'm sure you've heard of; I'm
      here to deal with that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: A fateful errand. No few have chafed to face the Worm since first he
      set his soul-snare here at Sovngarde's threshold.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: But Shor restrained our wrathful onslaught- perhaps, deep counseled,
      your doom he foresaw.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Listen, I know that entrance to the Hall of Valor requires beating you
      in combat-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So can we skip the whole "by whose right do you seek entry" thing?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: Special permissions must be granted for those who would dare enter Shor's
      Hall while still belonging to life.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>By right of blood. I am the dragonborn</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Happy?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: It has been too long since last I've faced a doom-driven hero of the
      dragon blood.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Can we just fight now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894200
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: Very well.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894201
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Tsun draws his axe to give {mc} the warrior's test.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118219413979188
    - rid: 1790118219413979189
    - rid: 1790118219413979190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: You fought well. I find you worthy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118219413979240
    - rid: 1790118219413979241
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: It is long since one of the living has entered here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67745692676d04c4ba502c64a1dbfa23, type: 2}
    dialog: May Shor's favor follow you and your errand.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Tsun steps to the side, letting me walk across the Whalebone Bridge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118219413979242
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's a bit outrageous that over the course of the entirety of creation,
      Shor has never invested in an <i>actual</i> bridge.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Whale skeletons aren't exactly made to be walked upon.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Managed to make it across-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118219413979243
    - rid: 1790118219413979244
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Despite the best efforts of the skeleton trying to catch my ankles.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: No point in wasting anymore time, I've got to meet up with the ancient
      Nords shown in the Elder Scroll.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: If I was Gormlaith, where would I be standing around...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118219413979245
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah, there they are.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 530167e172e34fd4bbbcf5df0eb05db4, type: 2}
    dialog: At long last, Alduin's doom is now ours to seal!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604672
    - rid: 1790118269016604673
    - rid: 1790118269016604675
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 530167e172e34fd4bbbcf5df0eb05db4, type: 2}
    dialog: Just speak the word and with high hearths we'll hasten forth to smite
      the worm, wherever he lurks.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well then, let's-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Actually...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Forgive me, but the bounties of Shor's banquet has got my stomach growling.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Can't fight a dragon on an empty stomach, can we?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be7d4bf59e4126046aadb631d33a56c5, type: 2}
    dialog: A smidgeon of revelry before the end, then.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I make my way over one of the oxen spits and get myself a nice plate
      of grub.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604676
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's all I could've wanted and more!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The heavenly feast really was heavenly. Go figure.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 530167e172e34fd4bbbcf5df0eb05db4, type: 2}
    dialog: We've wasted enough time here, I'm itching to slay that winged worm!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you have any other concerns that need addressing?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well, if I <i>can</i> be indulgent...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: To be honest, I don't think my current armor is up to the task.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Is there any way I could get equipped with some better gear?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be7d4bf59e4126046aadb631d33a56c5, type: 2}
    dialog: Your current armor <i>is</i> a bit damaged for a confrontation that will
      decide the fate of all of Nirn...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: Surely, one of the ancient heroes found in these halls would be able
      to aid you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... a lot of help you guys are!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I've talked to about every single one of these fellas and not a single
      one has the materials or know-how to forge some armor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604677
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm not sure if I should be outraged or not.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess I'll just have to fight Alduin like this-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Nord Hero Armor was equipped.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604678
    - rid: 1790118269016604679
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Nord Hero Gauntlets was equipped.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604680
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Nord Hero Boots was equipped.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604681
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604683
    - rid: 1790118269016604684
    - rid: 1790118269016604685
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Uh... what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The armor I'm wearing seems to be a mix between the Ancient Nord set
      that you unlock after completing the Companions questline-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And the Nordic Carved set added by the Dragonborn DLC.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 530167e172e34fd4bbbcf5df0eb05db4, type: 2}
    dialog: Hark! Your petitioning has not been lost on deaf ears!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604682
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be7d4bf59e4126046aadb631d33a56c5, type: 2}
    dialog: Shor himself descended from upon his high throne to grant you his boon!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Shor?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: He's here in the room with us?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I could've sworn since Shor is Lorkhan, who is <i>mostly</i> dead-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That his deliberate absence from his own hall was because he's the missing
      god.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not that he's just straight up invisible to the mortal eye!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course, this is his hall after all.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: His light is too pure for one whose eyes are trapped by mortal musings.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That's a weird way of putting that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's just go fight Alduin now...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604750
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: Hold comrades - let us counsel take before battle is blindly joined.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: Alduin's mist is more than a snare...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604751
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The implications of Shor directly interfering with me are... mortifying.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118269016604752
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '''Cause, you know, he''s been downright sundered.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: His body was split into two moons, his soul resides in the Shezzarines,
      his heart's... somewhere, probably.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And that's not even counting the deranged stuff like the dark heart.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: This is a <i>major</i> difference from the original story.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hopefully nothing too extreme comes of this.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894252
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: ... shouting together, and then unsheathe our blades in desperate battle
      with our black-winged foe.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894253
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah right, time to spam Clear Skies.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We really need to get our mileage out of the mandatory progression Shouts,
      eh devs?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>lok v4 k8r</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894254
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be7d4bf59e4126046aadb631d33a56c5, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>lok v4 k8r</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894255
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 530167e172e34fd4bbbcf5df0eb05db4, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>lok v4 k8r</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894256
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3a27c107ade02c48abd446b964760c6, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>lok v4 k8r</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894257
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894259
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Is Alduin not going to come restore his mist-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>z5 ni f1s g1ffesejul</font>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894260
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh, he's showing up early?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 530167e172e34fd4bbbcf5df0eb05db4, type: 2}
    dialog: To battle, my friends! The fields will echo with the clamor of war, our
      wills undaunted!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Should probably hit that big black bastard with a dose of dragonrend.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>j8r z4 frul</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894261
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: Dovahkiin, you annoying Lir! <font=dragonfont>nu hin sil d3</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894262
    - rid: 1790118286917894263
    - rid: 1790118286917894264
    - rid: 1790118286917894265
    - rid: 1790118286917894267
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Time to take this overgrown lizard down!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118286917894268
    - rid: 1790118286917894269
    - rid: 1790118286917894270
    - rid: 1790118286917894271
    - rid: 1790118286917894272
    - rid: 1790118286917894273
